
    <section id="public-page">
      <section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Made for listeners. Shaped by you.</span><h2>Your experience<br>makes us better.</h2><p class="lead">Tell the community what works, what could improve, and how WizeStream fits into your day.</p><a class="button primary" href="#write-review">Write a review <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="quiet">No account. No email. Always optional.</p></div>
        <aside class="rating-card" aria-labelledby="rating-title"><h2 id="rating-title">Community rating</h2><div class="score" id="average">—<small>/ 5</small></div><p id="rating-count" aria-live="polite">Loading reviews…</p><div id="distribution" class="distribution"></div><p class="quiet">Every published rating counts equally. Reviews are community feedback, not verified installations.</p></aside></section>
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">From the community</span><h2>Honest experiences.</h2></div><span id="review-total" class="chip">All ratings welcome</span></div>
      <p id="list-status" role="status"></p><div id="reviews" class="review-grid"></div><div class="pagination"><button type="button" id="previous" disabled>Previous</button><span id="page-label"></span><button type="button" id="next" disabled>Next</button></div>
      <section class="write-section" id="write-review"><div><span class="eyebrow">Leave your perspective</span><h2>Good, bad,<br>or somewhere between.</h2><p>Share a specific experience. For bugs or feature requests that need a reply, use <a href="https://github.com/wizdom13/WizeStream/discussions" rel="noreferrer">GitHub Discussions ↗</a>.</p><p class="quiet">Reviews are checked for spam, personal information and abuse before publication. A low rating is never a reason to reject a review.</p></div>
        <form id="review-form"><fieldset class="stars"><legend>Your rating</legend><div class="star-options"><label for="rating-1"><input id="rating-1" type="radio" name="rating" value="1" required><span>1 ★</span></label><label for="rating-2"><input id="rating-2" type="radio" name="rating" value="2"><span>2 ★</span></label><label for="rating-3"><input id="rating-3" type="radio" name="rating" value="3"><span>3 ★</span></label><label for="rating-4"><input id="rating-4" type="radio" name="rating" value="4"><span>4 ★</span></label><label for="rating-5"><input id="rating-5" type="radio" name="rating" value="5"><span>5 ★</span></label></div></fieldset>
          <label for="review-content">Your review</label><textarea id="review-content" name="content" minlength="10" maxlength="3000" rows="5" placeholder="What has your experience been like?" required></textarea><p class="field-help">10–3,000 characters. Please leave out personal information.</p>
          <div class="two-fields"><div><label for="nickname">Nickname <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input id="nickname" name="nickname" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Shown as Anonymous if blank"></div><div><label for="app-version">App version <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input id="app-version" name="appVersion" maxlength="32" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example, 1.41.0"></div></div>
          <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave blank</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
          <label class="check" for="review-consent"><input id="review-consent" type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>I agree to publish my rating, review, nickname and optional app version after moderation.</span></label><button class="primary" id="submit-review" type="submit">Submit for moderation</button><p id="submit-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form></section>
      <section class="receipt" id="receipt" hidden><span class="eyebrow">Your private receipt</span><h2 id="receipt-title">Save your deletion link.</h2><p id="receipt-message">This link lets you check or remove your review, without an account. Anyone with it can access your review. Keep it private.</p><label for="receipt-link">Private management link</label><input id="receipt-link" readonly><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="copy-receipt">Copy link</button><a class="button" id="open-receipt" href="?view=manage">Manage my review</a></div><p class="quiet">The page does not save the link in cookies or local/session storage. Your browser may retain it in URL history. Save it privately before leaving this page.</p></section>
    </section>
    <section id="manage-page" class="utility-page" hidden><span class="eyebrow">Private review management</span><h2>Your review.<br>Your choice.</h2><p>Your private link is the only key to this review. The key stays in the link fragment and is sent only in an authorization header.</p><div id="managed-review"></div><p id="manage-status" role="status"></p><button type="button" id="delete-review" class="danger" hidden>Delete my review permanently</button><a class="button" href="./">Back to community reviews</a></section>
    <section id="moderate-page" class="utility-page" hidden><span class="eyebrow">For the maintainer</span><h2>Review moderation.</h2><form id="moderator-login"><label for="moderator-key">Moderator key</label><input id="moderator-key" type="password" autocomplete="off" required><button type="submit" class="primary">Open queue</button></form><p class="quiet">Publish useful feedback regardless of its rating. Remove only spam, abuse, irrelevant content, duplicates or personal information.</p><div id="moderator-controls" class="actions" hidden><button type="button" data-state="pending">Pending</button><button type="button" data-state="published">Published</button><button type="button" id="moderator-logout">Lock</button></div><p id="moderator-status" role="status"></p><div id="moderator-reviews" class="review-grid"></div><div id="moderator-pagination" class="pagination" hidden><button type="button" id="mod-previous">Previous</button><span id="mod-page"></span><button type="button" id="mod-next">Next</button></div></section>
    <section class="privacy" id="privacy"><div><span class="eyebrow">A smaller data footprint</span><h2>Feedback, with privacy in mind.</h2></div><div><p>This service asks for no account, email, device identifier or viewing history. It uses no analytics, advertising, tracking cookies or third-party scripts. Only published reviews appear in the public list and rating.</p><p>The application does not store raw IP addresses. For spam protection it temporarily stores HMAC-derived address buckets in MySQL, shared across PHP workers. Bucket identifiers change each UTC hour and are not attached to reviews. They expire at the next UTC hour and are removed on the next request or scheduled cleanup. These are short-lived pseudonymous abuse records, not anonymous identities. The host and network providers still receive normal connection information and may have their own logs. This deployment is intended for GoDaddy hosting. The account owner controls the actual hosting logs and backup retention; the PHP service does not disable provider logs or backups. Contact the project maintainer through the linked GitHub project for privacy questions without posting private review links.</p><p>Pending reviews expire after 30 days; expired rows are removed on the next request or hourly scheduled cleanup. Published reviews remain until removed by their author or moderator. Deletion removes the live record; any operator-managed backups follow the operator’s retention policy. Private management links are bearer keys, not verified identities. No-account reviews cannot guarantee one vote per person.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/wizdom13/WizeStream" rel="noreferrer">Open-source project ↗</a> · <a href="?view=moderate">Maintainer moderation</a></p></div></section>
  <noscript><p class="empty">JavaScript is needed to load and submit reviews. No review is sent automatically.</p></noscript>